  "worked_solution": "To find every subset of $S,$ we list out every combination of elements within $S.$\n\n We can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14243624/assets/a741ce494203603a7a714b09f10f06cc32c281999e3c1a31178a2449945c88be.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n∅,\\{j\\},\\{l\\},\\{j,l\\}.\n$$",
